---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Health information policy"
  description="Our approach to traditional plant use, evidence, nutrition and safety."
>
  <header class="container page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Herb-All · Good to know</p>
    <h1>Health information policy</h1>
  </header>
  <section class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="sample-note">
        Starter educational disclaimer requiring owner, legal and qualified
        editorial review before commercial launch.
      </p>
      <h2>Education, not medical advice</h2>
      <p>
        Herb-All provides general educational information about plants,
        nutrition and traditional herbal practices. This information is not
        intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent disease and should not
        replace advice from a qualified healthcare professional.
      </p>
      <h2>Traditional use</h2>
      <p>
        A traditional practice is not proof of clinical effectiveness. Sources
        and cultural context need review before specific claims are published.
      </p>
      <h2>Nutritional properties</h2>
      <p>
        Whole foods, infusions and concentrated extracts are not
        interchangeable. Do not assume nutrient quantities or results carry over
        from one to another.
      </p>
      <h2>Current scientific evidence</h2>
      <p>
        References have not been supplied for starter articles. Scientific
        claims are reserved for qualified editorial review, not fabricated. No
        therapeutic outcomes are promised.
      </p>
      <h2>Safety considerations</h2>
      <p>
        Pregnancy, breastfeeding, children, allergies, medicines and chronic
        conditions can affect suitability. Herbs can interact with medication,
        and safe dosages are not always established. Ask a qualified healthcare
        professional for personal advice.
      </p>
      <h2>Keep prescribed care in place</h2>
      <p>
        Do not stop medication, delay medical care or replace established
        treatment based on these pages. Seek appropriate medical assistance for
        urgent health concerns.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
